  * *note derivedSeries: derivedSeries, -- compute the derived series of a set
    of vector fields
  * *note differences between certain bracketing functions: differences between
    certain bracketing functions, -- The difference between certain bracketing
    functions
  * *note VectorFields: Top, -- vector fields

Ways to use lowerCentralSeries:
===============================

  * "lowerCentralSeries(ZZ,Matrix)"
